WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.568
Today we're trying different sports

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:02.369
with the wrong ball!

00:00:02.369 --> 00:00:03.103
First up

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:04.437
Ping pong with a golf ball!

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:07.807
Oh, this works well!

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:08.742
Yeah it's...

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:09.809
Hey guys

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:10.810
Try this one!

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:11.878
*Throws bowling ball*

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:14.280
WHAAAT!?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.548
Yeah just try it out!

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:16.683
I'm sure it works!

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:18.785
Next up, volleyball!

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:20.787
Let's play a match against Lassi and Emil

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:21.721
What's our tactic?

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:22.922
I'll do all the diving!

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.424
I'll do the saving

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:26.526
and then you finish it!

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:27.861
To ten points

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:28.862
Here we go!

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:31.064
Yeah now we get it!

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:32.298
Okay Otto!

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:33.833
Yes!

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:37.504
You take?

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:42.542
Wooow!

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.677
Nice Miikka!

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:46.746
You take!

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:48.615
Nice!

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:49.549
Oh that's me!

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:50.250
You!

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:55.321
Nooo!

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:03.563
Emil!

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.065
What are you doing down there?

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:07.267
Okay Otto let's finish them!

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:12.372
Still in play!

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:14.441
Noooo!

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:17.911
Ten different sports

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.012
Ten different free kicks

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:19.879
Me against Lassi!

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:22.782
Yes!

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:24.484
That was a professional fake!

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:25.618
This is an easy one

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:27.654
Noo!!

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:28.488
Volleyball!

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:30.924
Oh what a save!

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:32.459
I think you can directly

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:33.593
just give up on this one

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:34.360
No way!

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:36.096
No

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.197
He's not going to save that one!

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:38.765
Oh, this is easy!

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:43.803
In the face!

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:46.039
The bowling ball!

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:47.273
Adrenaline where are you?

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:50.577
You saved it like it was nothing!

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:56.282
Oh no!

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.084
Yeah you almost saved it!

00:01:58.451 --> 00:01:59.152
You ready Lassi?

00:01:59.152 --> 00:01:59.819
Yeah I'm ready!

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:01.888
Check this save

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:02.422
Look at this!

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:10.797
Okay Lassi it all comes down to this one!

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:11.431
I know!

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:15.602
No it slipped!

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.270
You can hop in for one

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.505
I'll kick it from really far!

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:25.211
Basketball with an American football

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:26.579
First try!

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:32.685
Okay

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:38.258
That was a bit too easy!

00:02:38.525 --> 00:02:39.959
Basketball frisbee

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:54.240
Okay

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:55.675
It's football's turn!

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:57.911
Bam!

00:02:59.779 --> 00:03:00.480
Baseball

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.114
Basketball

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:13.092
Woow!

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:17.497
That took a while!

00:03:17.931 --> 00:03:18.531
Next one!

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:21.167
Let's try which ball works best for tennis!

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:22.835
Serve with the bouncy ball

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:23.970
You don't wanna be here?

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.637
No, I don't!

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:25.939
I definitely don't want to be here!

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:30.977
A bit dangerous maybe?

00:03:33.313 --> 00:03:34.214
Where did it go!?

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:38.184
Wooooow!?

00:03:38.518 --> 00:03:38.985
What!?

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:39.953
How is that possible?

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:40.987
And the extreme

00:03:40.987 --> 00:03:42.322
bouncy ball - baseball shot

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:44.657
Make sure to watch until the end!

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:46.059
We're going to need some

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:47.193
bigger balls

00:03:47.393 --> 00:03:48.027
for this one!

00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:49.195
Super bouncy ball!

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:51.297
Straight in the face!

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:52.565
It's three times

00:03:52.565 --> 00:03:53.700
bigger than the racket

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:55.268
Oh, nice!

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:57.670
Come on!

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.305
It's still in play Emil!

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:03.076
This is the best ball so far!

00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:05.378
Yes!

00:04:13.386 --> 00:04:14.220
Winner!

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:15.021
Fun and tough!

00:04:15.021 --> 00:04:15.855
But that's why it's called

00:04:15.855 --> 00:04:16.723
an exercise ball!

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:19.092
We are out here on the golf course

00:04:19.092 --> 00:04:20.526
and we're going to draw

00:04:20.526 --> 00:04:22.262
which ball each one of us gets!

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:23.463
American football

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:24.530
Volleyball!

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.232
Table tennis ball!

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:28.201
My ball is the only one

00:04:28.201 --> 00:04:29.702
that actually fits in the hole!

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:31.037
It's the wrong way!

00:04:32.238 --> 00:04:32.805
My shot

00:04:32.805 --> 00:04:34.107
I can do however I like!

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:36.175
Good shot Miikka!

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:37.343
I'll go with an iron

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:38.177
Show it!

00:04:39.979 --> 00:04:41.881
It's continuing into the forest!

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:43.516
That's in a good place!

00:04:44.517 --> 00:04:44.917
Whoa!

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:48.421
Look at that!

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:49.589
Calculated shot!

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:53.726
I could say that it's not Miikka

00:04:53.726 --> 00:04:54.494
who's winning this!

00:04:54.961 --> 00:04:55.928
Fourth shot..

00:04:56.696 --> 00:04:57.263
Yes!

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:59.032
I think that's my best shot so far

00:05:01.668 --> 00:05:03.236
No way!

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:04.304
Good shot!

00:05:05.538 --> 00:05:06.239
No, no, no, no!

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:09.509
That doesn't count!

00:05:11.144 --> 00:05:11.611
Whoah

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:12.278
Your best one!

00:05:12.779 --> 00:05:14.347
At least I look like a pro golfer

00:05:14.347 --> 00:05:15.081
don't I?

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:17.016
No!

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:18.017
Come on!

00:05:18.017 --> 00:05:20.119
It bounced over the sandpit

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.088
This is clearly a shot for that racket

00:05:22.088 --> 00:05:22.755
Thanks Miikka!

00:05:22.755 --> 00:05:23.456
Good caddying!

00:05:25.091 --> 00:05:25.525
No!

00:05:25.525 --> 00:05:26.192
Hit the tree!

00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:27.093
Behind the trunk!

00:05:27.593 --> 00:05:28.594
He's for sure

00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:29.796
going to hit the stump

00:05:29.796 --> 00:05:31.030
Are you 100% sure?

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:31.564
Yeah

00:05:31.564 --> 00:05:32.932
I'd like to say 200

00:05:34.901 --> 00:05:36.102
Oh, he got it!

00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:37.870
It went over!

00:05:38.204 --> 00:05:39.272
Very proud of you Emil!

00:05:39.272 --> 00:05:39.839
That was very good

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.842
How did I get it too far!?

00:05:42.842 --> 00:05:44.243
You got to have it land in the hole

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:45.545
I don't think so Miikka

00:05:45.545 --> 00:05:46.446
It's golf Emil

00:05:46.446 --> 00:05:47.513
Have you played golf before?

00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:48.881
You've got to get it in the hole!

00:05:49.215 --> 00:05:50.183
True, that's true

00:05:53.653 --> 00:05:54.320
Now the next one

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:55.388
you just have to lift it!

00:05:55.888 --> 00:05:56.322
My turn?

00:05:56.322 --> 00:05:57.557
I mean that's probably the rule

00:05:57.557 --> 00:05:58.391
Shoot him away!

00:05:58.391 --> 00:05:59.392
Now it's Miikka

00:05:59.792 --> 00:06:01.227
Let's take it home!

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:02.595
Not the amount of shots

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.298
Yeeesss!!

00:06:06.933 --> 00:06:07.667
Now it's your time

00:06:07.667 --> 00:06:08.368
to win the game

00:06:09.469 --> 00:06:10.737
Well done Otto!

00:06:10.737 --> 00:06:11.471
The winner!

00:06:11.471 --> 00:06:12.905
Let's move away from here

00:06:13.005 --> 00:06:13.639
Squash!

00:06:14.273 --> 00:06:14.974
With a floorball!

00:06:39.799 --> 00:06:41.033
It's so broken!

00:06:41.334 --> 00:06:42.335
Look at this!

00:06:42.535 --> 00:06:44.337
Bouncy ball is pure chaos!

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:52.011
It went through all the walls!

00:06:52.445 --> 00:06:53.045
I was like:

00:06:53.045 --> 00:06:54.247
I'm hitting it over there

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:55.314
it can't end up here!

00:06:55.481 --> 00:06:56.649
It looks very dangerous

00:07:03.856 --> 00:07:05.258
What is going on!?

00:07:07.493 --> 00:07:08.594
It's going to come here

00:07:11.564 --> 00:07:12.265
Like I said!

00:07:12.265 --> 00:07:13.766
Welcome to the box!

00:07:15.501 --> 00:07:16.369
Okay go!

00:07:21.541 --> 00:07:22.308
That was..

00:07:23.142 --> 00:07:24.777
It sounds very risky!

00:07:30.216 --> 00:07:31.684
You broke the chair!

00:07:31.951 --> 00:07:33.152
I was just testing

00:07:33.152 --> 00:07:34.420
if the bench works!

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:35.855
I think I'm done with this...

00:07:36.155 --> 00:07:37.690
Maybe that's dangerous enough!

00:07:38.057 --> 00:07:38.658
So next up

00:07:38.658 --> 00:07:40.026
we're going to try baseball!

00:07:40.026 --> 00:07:42.028
We have an ex-professional hitter

00:07:42.295 --> 00:07:44.163
And a professional catcher

00:07:46.532 --> 00:07:47.233
I'm good!

00:07:47.433 --> 00:07:48.034
I'm good!

00:07:48.234 --> 00:07:49.101
First ball

00:07:49.402 --> 00:07:50.169
shuttlecock!

00:07:54.874 --> 00:07:55.541
Touchdown!

00:07:55.541 --> 00:07:56.108
No home run?

00:07:56.309 --> 00:07:56.909
Hockey puck!

00:07:58.744 --> 00:07:59.979
You're hitting them quite well

00:07:59.979 --> 00:08:00.947
so I'd say we move on

00:08:00.947 --> 00:08:02.215
to more difficult ones

00:08:02.582 --> 00:08:03.616
I'll try and catch it!

00:08:03.916 --> 00:08:04.650
Yeah!

00:08:06.118 --> 00:08:06.853
American football!

00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:10.056
Whoah!

00:08:10.523 --> 00:08:12.425
We've got it pretty far with the other balls

00:08:12.425 --> 00:08:13.826
but I think the bouncy ball

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:15.228
should be

00:08:15.495 --> 00:08:16.896
the one that takes the victory

00:08:17.129 --> 00:08:18.364
I think this white line

00:08:18.364 --> 00:08:19.298
is a good goal

00:08:19.732 --> 00:08:21.133
Like if we can get it here

00:08:21.501 --> 00:08:23.236
that must be like 150 meters

00:08:23.836 --> 00:08:24.537
You ready Otto?

00:08:25.137 --> 00:08:25.538
Go!

00:08:31.477 --> 00:08:32.645
I found a bouncy ball

00:08:32.645 --> 00:08:33.846
200 meters away

00:08:33.846 --> 00:08:35.481
from the hitting area!

00:08:35.681 --> 00:08:37.450
I think this might go the furthest

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.285
if I can get a clean hit on it

00:08:39.519 --> 00:08:41.220
I think there is a text on the golf ball

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:41.687
It says..

00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:42.288
I think it says

00:08:42.288 --> 00:08:42.822
Subscribe!

00:08:43.389 --> 00:08:44.290
Subscribe to Pongfinity!

00:08:44.423 --> 00:08:44.957
Do it!

00:08:45.658 --> 00:08:45.958
Ready!

00:08:46.359 --> 00:08:46.692
Set!

00:08:47.026 --> 00:08:47.460
Go!

00:08:49.195 --> 00:08:50.162
Whoah!

00:08:50.162 --> 00:08:51.330
Where did it go?

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.932
It went out the court!

00:08:52.932 --> 00:08:54.033
Really it did?

00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:54.567
Yeah

00:08:54.567 --> 00:08:56.435
Luckily it didn't go on the buildings!

00:08:56.435 --> 00:08:57.737
I sliced it!

00:08:57.737 --> 00:08:59.105
That could have been lethal!

00:08:59.105 --> 00:09:00.940
The winner of the baseball challenge

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:01.607
was:

00:09:01.807 --> 00:09:02.708
the bouncy ball!

00:09:02.708 --> 00:09:03.709
Or the golf ball!

00:09:03.943 --> 00:09:04.810
Oh wait Otto

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:05.845
we still have the bowling ball!

00:09:08.114 --> 00:09:08.581
Okay!

